{"4220820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Polyarmory: High Calibre Love", "steam_appid": 4220820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220820/extras/3e0539a86b4dc588ddda1e6ea0e8b2fc.avif?t=1782041066\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world's only fully-loaded conspiracy theorist gun-nut dating simulation. We'll bang, okay?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the prepper, take the mysterious pill Caliber™ to awaken an arsenal of alluring companions and fight against the dark forces determined to tear you apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day that goes by, you'll learn more about your lovely companions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rimington, the hunky shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viper, the chaotic revolver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marsh &amp; Mello, aka &quot;The Twins&quot; (they aren't related).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Svetlana, the RPG with an explosive temper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show them that you know how to handle them and together, they'll take you on a journey of self-discovery that you never realised you needed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five gorgeous guns to spend your time with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A manly friendship with a friend over the radio waves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the power of Caliber™ in a safe and comfortable location!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense shooter action - fight against hordes as they try to take your guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>100% Streamer Safe!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>THREE</strong> hours of the truth-telling podcast <i>The Colt Michigan Experience</i>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against the ever-present creeping feelings of loneliness and despair!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep lore dripping from every crack and crevice!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220820/extras/26de4253840b9ee15bde36c200d4883f.avif?t=1782041066\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220820/extras_big/26de4253840b9ee15bde36c200d4883f.webp?t=1782041066 width=1560 height=1776 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220820/extras/3e0539a86b4dc588ddda1e6ea0e8b2fc.avif?t=1782041066\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world's only fully-loaded conspiracy theorist gun-nut dating simulation. We'll bang, okay?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the prepper, take the mysterious pill Caliber™ to awaken an arsenal of alluring companions and fight against the dark forces determined to tear you apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day that goes by, you'll learn more about your lovely companions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rimington, the hunky shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viper, the chaotic revolver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marsh &amp; Mello, aka &quot;The Twins&quot; (they aren't related).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Svetlana, the RPG with an explosive temper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show them that you know how to handle them and together, they'll take you on a journey of self-discovery that you never realised you needed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph